cff-version: 1.2.0
title: mWater Asset Standards
message: Please cite the specific standard and version used, as shown below.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Open data standards for water and sanitation asset management, defining asset
  classes, asset types, and coded attributes with data types, units and permitted
  values. Published as machine-readable CSV and JSON with a JSON Schema validator.
authors:
  - name: mWater Foundation, Inc.
    country: US
    email: info@mwater.co
    website: https://www.mwater.co
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/mWater/asset-standards
url: https://github.com/mWater/asset-standards
keywords:
  - water supply
  - sanitation
  - asset management
  - data standard
  - WASH
  - SDG 6
references:
